# GORGOROTH colors for KDE Plasma
# Port of the Black Metal Gorgoroth palette (metalelf0/black-metal-theme-neovim).
# Authoritative source: kitty black-metal-gorgoroth.conf (extras oficial).
# Structure: copy of BreezeDark.colors, roles recolored to the palette.
#   bg #000000 (vistas/editor) · #222222 (ventanas, gap, selection bg)
#   #2a2325 (alternado/inactivo) · fg #c1c1c1 · teal #5f8787 (acento, bordes, error)
#   #ddeecc (positivo/ok) · #9b8d7f (visitado) · #505050/#888888/#aaaaaa/#999999 (dim)

